{"v":4,"catch":"保持緊張！ 擁抱那些曲線！！！","desc":"《POLE POSITION》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於 1982 年發行的賽車遊戲。\n比賽分為排位賽和大獎賽。 如果你在排位賽中跑得好，你將晉級大獎賽。\n使用您的駕駛技術贏得POLE POSITION！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-07-06","genres":["競速","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/729073eeaa616234609769d499849b0a626f0490cc47ab1e21aca3883f87de2a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8b643c72c69ccc8eab1f5391e9f7ebb57a7ad269d1a4da142130f7b98dc75aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ecf20a1dbda4e24df5ea97a6c35bed85f810051900e3e54ab36b688b8a4af48.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81d8e29d5bf30408a04bca9926578ec5667dcb6f0836b112b8231325704e9120.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ab71207d19cb208266a30d2a6f9e4c407368003ed05683399e236720074785b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ad6d6f16e98184d3c34eecc0545594c4a531304449368529d8ff4da4f98cc801.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b5001a6a8000","dlc":[]}